{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hostile Lands is a 2D top-down roguelite shooter where a crash landing is mistaken for an act of war. The game moves through 7 environments, where players will encounter many types of enemies, find many unique weapons and discover the reason behind the crash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With procedurally generated levels, alternate bosses, and random gun spawns, players will have a unique experience every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075890/extras/Weapons_Title.png?t=1746208593\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075890/extras/Weapons.gif?t=1746208593\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Collect them All!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 different gun types for all play styles: Pistols, Revolvers, Shotguns, SMGs, Assault Rifles, Sniper Rifles, Crossbows, Bladeguns\u2026and perhaps some secrets you\u2019ll just have to discover for yourself\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075890/extras/Characters_Title.png?t=1746208593\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075890/extras/Characters.png?t=1746208593\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Play your way!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each character has a unique skill that you can use once per level. So whether you want to decimate your enemies with Robert\u2019s Blazing Barrels or turn them against each other with Maria\u2019s Psych Strike, you\u2019ll hold your own in the Hostile Lands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plus every character has a passive buff so if you want a little extra speed to dodge bullets or some extra health to absorb them, we got you covered!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075890/extras/Environments_Title.png?t=1746208593\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075890/extras/Environments.gif?t=1746208593\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Some Hostile Variety!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each with its own theme, enemies, bosses and loot will guarantee a new experience every run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075890/extras/Upgrades_Title.png?t=1746208593\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075890/extras/Upgrades.png?t=1746208593\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Feel the Power!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every run you\u2019ll gain \u201cTech\u201d points which can be used to purchases upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our permanent progression system means you get to keep your hard won achievements\u2026even when starting a new run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075890/extras/Game_Modes_Title.png?t=1746208593\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075890/extras/Game_Modes.png?t=1746208593\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Lots of Options!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Normal - when you\u2019re just starting out. Try, fail, buy some upgrades, dominate your foes and prepare for the mayhem of Hard Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hard Mode - when you need a challenge. More enemies, more bullets, more guns!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survival - how long can you last against continuous waves of vicious enemies howling for your blood?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075890/extras/Early_Access_Title.png?t=1746208593\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We have lots of ideas to make Hostile Lands a memorable experience\u2026but we can\u2019t do it without you!\u00a0\u00a0If you have any suggestions or need to report a bug please leave a comment in our discussion boards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3075890?t=1746208593","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075890/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746208593","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075890/88ccdc5f78da77c6c9ed0c0f0d0131e35a76020c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746208593","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075890/88ccdc5f78da77c6c9ed0c0f0d0131e35a76020c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746208593","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3295590,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hostile Lands is a 2D top-down roguelite shooter where a crash landing is mistaken for an act of war. The game moves through 7 environments, where players will encounter many 